I wake up early.
It is only six o'clock.
It is a new day.
I lie in bed for a bit.
Then I get up.
I walk over to the window.
I look out at the city.
The morning is cold and clear.
It is still dark outside.
A streetlight is on outside.
But it is very windy.
The wind is very cold.
It is still cold outside.
I open my closet.
I look at my clothes.
I find a sweater.
It is thick and soft.
I put the warm sweater on.
It is perfect for a cold day.
Now I am ready for the day.
